# Reads only files on disk; reaches no database, so it needs no credentials and
# deliberately does not import src/lib/ciSupabaseGuard.mjs. It is what makes the
# guard's coverage a fact rather than a claim: the guard is OPT-IN, and this
# asserts that every file under src/ that can reach Supabase either opted in or
# is on an exempt list, in source, with a written reason per entry.
run_check "check:guard-coverage" pnpm run check:guard-coverage
